<title>PHILIPPINES: Philrealty 9-mth net 191.027 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Philrealty 9-mth net 191.027 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine Realty and Holdings Corp (Philrealty) said on Monday it posted a net income of 191.027 million pesos in the first nine months of the year.</p>
<p>The firm said its revenues reached 721.609 million pesos.</p>
<p>Philrealty did not give comparative figures.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
</text>
